{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q105338009","formula":"C₃₂H₃₉N₇O₄","hill":"C32H39N7O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":32.0,"H":39.0,"N":7.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Mobocertinib","ru":"Мобоцертиниб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Mobocertinib, sold under the brand name Exkivity, is used for the treatment of non-small cell lung cancer. The most common side effects include diarrhea, rash, nausea, stomatitis, vomiting, decreased appetite, paronychia, fatigue, dry skin, and musculoskeletal pain. Mobocertinib is a small molecule tyrosine kinase inhibitor structurally similar to osimertinib (differs only by the presence of an additional isopropyl ester group).","ru":"Мобоцертиниб, продаваемый под торговой маркой Exkivity, — лекарственный препарат, который применяют для лечения немелкоклеточного рака лёгких. В частности, он используется при прогрессирующем раке с мутацией в виде вставки в 20-м экзоне рецептора эпидермального фактора роста (EGFR). Мобоцертиниб принимают внутрь один раз в день."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":118607832,"mass":585.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)OC(=O)C1=CN=C(N=C1C2=CN(C3=CC=CC=C32)C)NC4=C(C=C(C(=C4)NC(=O)C=C)N(C)CCN(C)C)OC","inchikey":"AZSRSNUQCUDCGG-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"propan-2-yl 2-[4-[2-(dimethylamino)ethyl-methylamino]-2-methoxy-5-(prop-2-enoylamino)anilino]-4-(1-methylindol-3-yl)pyrimidine-5-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"118607832","atoms":82,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.25,"y":2.141,"z":-3.043,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.406,"y":1.974,"z":-1.536,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.743,"y":3.305,"z":-0.876,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.16,"y":1.524,"z":-0.971,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.94,"y":0.185,"z":-1.007,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.685,"y":-0.662,"z":-1.464,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.636,"y":-0.082,"z":-0.395,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.532,"y":0.639,"